  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1214175.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-blue?style=plastic&link=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《瓶中时光》（独立版）的一个简单附加组件，允许你在<strong>挂机（AFK）</strong>时增加<b>瓶子</b>中存储的时间。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Time In A Bottle Plus Plus/screen/gif.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"784\" height=\"236\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在由玩家引发的绝大多数游戏事件中，有一定几率增加你存储的总时间。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">事件选择、任何弹出窗口、显示类型、成功/失败几率等都可以通过<a href=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/TimeInABottle-Plus-Plus/blob/main/src/main/java/com/devdyna/tiabplusplus/core/Config.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置文件</a>进行修改。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>时间增减器</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Time In A Bottle Plus Plus/screen/items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"item\" width=\"264\" height=\"103\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">无法通过常规手段获取的物品，主要用于随机增加或减少时间，特别适用于模组包（例如作为奖励给予玩家额外的瓶中时光）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>所有内容均可自定义：<a href=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/TimeInABottle-Plus-Plus/blob/main/src/main/java/com/devdyna/tiabplusplus/core/Config.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置文件</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/TimeInABottle-Plus-Plus/tree/main/src/main/resources/data/tiabplusplus/tags\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a>！</strong></span></p>",
